      "text": "Bessie Smith\nBessie Smith ( April 15 , 1894 -- September 26 , 1937 ) was an American blues singer . Nicknamed the Empress of the Blues , she was the most popular female blues singer of the 1920s and 1930s . She is often regarded as one of the greatest singers of her era and was a major influence on other jazz singers ."
